<title>ISRAEL: TABLE-SUPER-SOL Q2 EPS 1.5 SHEKELS VS 1.52.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SUPER-SOL Q2 EPS 1.5 SHEKELS VS 1.52.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Super-Sol Ltd reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>			   Q2 97	Q2 96    6-MTH 97   6-MTH 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  1,147,208  857,993  2,172,918  1,720,754</p>
<p>Operating Profit	  37,492   36,634     75,511     74,788</p>
<p>Net Profit		  26,104   26,659     46,421     48,521</p>
<p>Earnings per share	  1.50     1.52	 2.65	 2.75</p>
<p>($1 = 3.53 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
